msgstr ":ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL<SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` = 33（DJI FPV）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-msp-osd-overview-4.2.rst:128
#: 150906f3c7c545ea8885fe068040d9f9 230ca579d48b41c3bc5a615af7f496c2
#: 2853089413f445a0a26846efe6874f0d 60a0936f50374071937d7997e6b3fe51
#: 8da27cfc89eb4312a51cabcb28bf1e3c
msgid ":ref:`MSP_OPTIONS<MSP_OPTIONS>` bit 0 = 0 (Do not EnableTelemetryMode)"
msgstr ":ref:`MSP_OPTIONS<MSP_OPTIONS>` 第 0 位 = 0（不启用数传模式）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-msp-osd-overview-4.2.rst:129
#: 058d7ae0dc9e4d029fbc0870329c8262 370effa5403349ef9c6bc39bbab42927
#: b0c0d6a65f484efca2e491544e712074 f79bdc9a8a3741d481647799d3982b7c
#: fab5a671431844a1abcde5f2c67b616b
msgid ""
":ref:`MSP_OPTIONS<MSP_OPTIONS>` bit 2 = 1 (EnableBTFLFonts) forces ArduPilot"
" to impersonate Betaflight and use a Betaflight compatible font index for "
"the font table integrated in the remote OSD system. This is required since "
"the goggles do not have an ArduPilot compatible fonts table."
msgstr ""
":ref:`MSP_OPTIONS<MSP_OPTIONS>` 第 2 位 = 1（EnableBTFLFonts），强制 ArduPilot 模拟 "
"Betaflight 并使用与 Betaflight 兼容的字体索引访问远程 OSD 系统中集成的字体表。由于眼镜没有 ArduPilot "
"兼容字体表，因此需要此设置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-msp-osd-overview-4.2.rst:130
#: 030ea9d8b431402ab915f15ee384ca36 04892b7ec7804d3f88a611a853a34d3c
#: 0d86e0abbc2d4bf0a1beafc86945310b 0ef1507b6947402294e7e398765545bd
#: cb5187126aaf443f9f88f0a1751ebf96
msgid ""
":ref:`OSD_OPTIONS<OSD_OPTIONS>` bit 5 = 1 (TranslateArrows) use corrected "
"direction arrows when using the Betaflight fonts."
msgstr ""
":ref:`OSD_OPTIONS<OSD_OPTIONS>` 第 5 位 = 1（TranslateArrows），在使用 Betaflight "
"字体时使用校正后的方向箭头。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-msp-osd-overview-4.2.rst:132
#: b5a1eea0177a46dca022d8968b857cca
msgid ""
"Serial port buad rate default is changed to 115.2Kbaud automatically when "
"setting the above protocol type. However, if the user has previously or "
"subsequently changes the baud, this default will not be used. 115.2Kbaud is "
"required by most video goggle systems."
msgstr ""
"设置上述协议类型时，串口波特率默认自动更改为 115.2Kbaud。但如果用户之前或之后更改了波特率，则不会使用此默认值。大多数视频眼镜系统需要 "
"115.2Kbaud。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-msp-osd-overview-4.2.rst:134
#: 289298662aab4462aae7c9e44f072f18 429a1c56d2034bc09ccb5134b40c885f
